                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJI-1f22mtQjQRxIYULxKwW6I/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWVlQyTnJTRGhyWm05bWRGbFFhRGxKTkZac2VWRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This cafe is truly perfect for families! The cafe has two floors, with a great children\u0027s playroom on the second floor. It provides building blocks for kids to play freely, and adults can also take a break and relax with afternoon tea. On the first floor, besides the cafe seating area, there are many cute items to browse, and even a gashapon machine outside, so kids will never be bored. The tableware design is also very eye-catching, so cute you can\u0027t help but take pictures.\n\nThe indoor seating is a bit cramped, and it got quite crowded on a weekend afternoon. The staff seemed incredibly busy, but their service was still very polite and patient, making the experience very comfortable. The waffles were adorable and tasted good; the drinks were just average. Overall, finding such a cute and family-friendly cafe near Qiyan Station was a pleasant surprise, and I would definitely bring my kids back!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "這間咖啡廳真的非常適合親子前往！店面共有兩層樓，二樓設有一間很棒的親子遊戲室，提供積木讓孩子自在玩耍，大人也能稍微喘口氣、放鬆享受下午茶。一樓除了咖啡廳座位區外，還有販售許多可愛的商品可以逛，店外甚至還有扭蛋機，孩子完全不會無聊。餐具設計也非常吸睛，可愛到讓人忍不住一直拍照。\n室內座位稍微偏擁擠，假日下午來用餐人潮較多，感覺店員忙到幾乎沒有停下來，不過服務態度依然很客氣、也很有耐心，讓人感覺很舒服。鬆餅造型相當可愛，口感也不錯；飲料表現則比較普通一些。整體而言，能在奇岩站附近發現這麼可愛又親子友善的咖啡廳，真的很驚喜，會想再帶孩子回訪！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
